  <item>
    <title>观察室 | 马思纯也减肥50斤？从《瘦身男女》到《热辣滚烫》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65db5463b6c9256aee413823</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65db5463b6c9256aee413823</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Feb 2024 14:53:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>录这期节目的缘由在，前几日（2024.02.18）看到了马思纯发布的了她的减肥Vlog，宣布她减肥了50斤，也为她的新电视剧《烟火人家》宣传造势。</span></p><span></span><p><span>减肥作为普遍的社会热点话题，在这个春节档变得格外敏感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本节目录制的这个周末，贾玲的电影《热烈滚烫》票房已经突破32亿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着票房节节高升，跟电影，跟体重，跟减肥的热议也逐渐多了起来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目就来探讨一下，传统减肥电影的套路，女明星体重和我们的身体究竟由谁做主？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>show note</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a></span></a><span>开年第一天，马思纯也宣布减重50斤</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a></span></a><span>肥胖的标准：医学标准/社会标准</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a></span></a><span>体重秤APP都妄图为你的体重在人群中排序</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">04:54</a></span></a><span>减肥主题电影，早在2001年就有《瘦身男女》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a></span></a><span>对韩国整容的刻板印象《丑女大翻身》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a></span></a><span>传统减肥电影，对社会标准的妥协</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a></span></a><span>逆袭短剧追求爽感，上位者特权不变</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a></span></a><span>引发恐惧，还好我不胖/不穷/不丑</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a></span></a><span>为什么《热辣滚烫》不一样</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a></span></a><span>李雪琴演小三？演出不一样的妩媚态度</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a></span></a><span>李雪琴的出圈新闻，瘦到100斤才能被抱起来？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a></span></a><span>电影《热辣滚烫》中对胖人的态度堪称乌托邦</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a></span></a><span>《鲸》电影中令人刺痛的眼神，胖人悲伤的自我循环</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a></span></a><span>身材对于女明星，绕不过的一道坎</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1325">22:05</a></span></a><span>凭什么听于正的，为了好看要瘦到BMI15.9以下？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a></span></a><span>郑爽减肥，一天只吃一个苹果</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1494">24:54</a></span></a><span>《狼狈》新时代的浮士德，女明星与魔鬼做交易</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a></span></a><span>乐盈的新脚本，我的身体/生活我做主</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1641">27:21</a></span></a><span>马思纯减肥：只有瘦下来才能演角色？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">27:54</a></span></a><span>口碑和票房双双扑街的《第一炉香》</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a></span></a><span>马思纯解读葛薇龙，万物皆可言情小说</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">30:22</a></span></a><span>完全符合社会标准，可能不会得到“被承诺”的东西</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1869">31:09</a></span></a><span>瑞希威瑟斯彭：从“律政俏佳人”到女性电影制作公司老板</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538772168&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=963895684#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a></span></a><span>不要再把“美”的标准，交给别人</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：</span><em><span>贾玲《一切都来得及》</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目提到的电影：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>2001《瘦身男女》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2006《丑女大翻身》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2022《鲸》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2012《狼狈》</span></p><span></span><p><span>2021《第一炉香》</span></p>]]></description>
